    "description": "<p>Effect: The user takes -15 less Physical Damage and -25 less Special Damage while equipped, and has their Base SPD reduced by 15%.<br><br>@UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-species.r1xs6gQqlJMm5onZ]{Charcadet} users increase their Base DEF by +20, Base SPDEF by +30, and decrease Base SPD by -10, and increase the Power of their Special-Category Attacks by 30%.</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(239, 230, 216); font-family: Signika, &#x27;Palatino Linotype&#x27;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none\">@UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-species.eE3eVsnw34zNbLxo]{Armarouge} users deal +10% more damage with @Trait[pulse] and @Trait[missile] Attacks, and increase the Accuracy of their Special-Category Attacks by 15%.</span><br><br>A Charcadet may consume this item in order to trigger Evolution.</p>",
